    of this turn. If a "Ninja" monster(s) or "Ninjitsu Art" card(s) you control would
    be destroyed by battle or an opponent''s card effect, you can banish 1 "Ninja"
    monster from your GY instead. You can only use each effect of "Hidden Village
    of Ninjitsu Arts" once per turn.'
